PLACEHOLDER: VE screenshot needed

This file should be replaced with an actual screenshot showing:
- Player character mid-air (Y > 0.3m)
- Keybind legend open showing "Space jump"
- VE success message

To capture:
1. Start SpacetimeDB: ./tools/scripts/ensure-local-spacetime.sh
2. Publish module: cd server && spacetime publish fardel --yes
3. Run client: cd web && npm run dev
4. Open: http://localhost:5173/?ve=jump
5. Wait for "Jump OK" message
6. Take screenshot
7. Save as ve/babylon-jump.png (replace this file)
8. Force-add: git add -f ve/babylon-jump.png
9. Amend: git commit --amend --no-edit
10. Push: git push -f origin cursor/fix-jump-space-ec43
